{"tmdb":1461490,"tagline":"The true story of an American dreamer.","synopsis":"Based on the life of Milton Hershey, founder of the iconic Hershey chocolate company. Milton's grit and determination to conquer the world of candy-making propel him from bankruptcy to monumental success, and the love of his life, Kitty, helps him build a legacy sweeter than any candy bar. But when Kitty falls ill, Milton’s wild optimism teeters on the edge of destruction, and she sparks an even bolder dream: to leave their fortune in the hands of America’s children in need.","directors":[{"name":"Mark Waters","id":54050}],"cast":[{"actor":"Finn Wittrock","role":"Milton Hershey","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/gwGMGTmli0uBF7eAhhXePWhYNFJ.jpg","tmdb":168877},{"actor":"Alexandra Daddario","role":"Kitty Hershey","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/6qiLUZZYBE4FsrG8irWbb3I7P1n.jpg","tmdb":109513},{"actor":"Alan Ruck","role":"Henry Hershey","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/hj7CuWinT12hMKjRhSO4XEMVq7w.jpg","tmdb":2394},{"actor":"Richard Kind","role":"Joseph Royer","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/yWmuVQeQUzb5OSMVDoWkR0IylCK.jpg","tmdb":21125},{"actor":"David Costabile","role":"Tobias Thornhill","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/jTouM1QK24TXy5Q3T40t4AhR8GH.jpg","tmdb":82167},{"actor":"Heléne Yorke","role":"Margaret","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ez1JE0OnbHpSJ9j7pybIHplozcP.jpg","tmdb":1465303},{"actor":"Michael Moreland","role":"Lebbie","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/yLPW1VGq3RbUURBKwRZU13lZBWb.jpg","tmdb":1047642},{"actor":"Francesca Faridany","role":"Fanny Hershey","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/fbXecW3S1MJMWWCIVgWWB3WcGfr.jpg","tmdb":171733},{"actor":"Daniel David Stewart","role":"Murrie","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/4rVIcLqueOMwLKX54UCYEHBpRwf.jpg","tmdb":1715524},{"actor":"Dina Spybey-Waters","role":"Aunt Mattie","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/aBW0vvA5nms1X3LQJYGWAGsxc2s.jpg","tmdb":56567},{"actor":"Cha